    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Fathom is a San Francisco-based, for-profit public company (ticker: FTHM) founded in 2020 that operates the Fathom AI Notetaker platform. The company describes itself as a tool that captures, transcribes, and summarizes calls on Zoom, Google Meet, and Microsoft Teams, with a free tier for individuals and paid features aimed at teams.\n\nThe core product automates meeting notes, generates AI-powered summaries, and pushes action items and call insights directly into CRM systems without manual data entry. Additional features include an \"Ask Fathom\" search interface for querying meeting history, customizable summary templates, and AI Scorecards that the company describes as providing real-time coaching moments and follow-up metrics to help managers assess and improve team performance.\n\nThe held facts show Fathom is registered with the SEC under CIK 0001753162 and maintains an MCP server called ai.fathom.api/mcp, described as giving AI assistants real meeting context so that outputs are grounded in a user's actual work. No litigation is recorded in the held facts.",
